{"seq":2,"slug":"language-and-society","title":"语言与社会","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-identity","title":"语言与身份","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-identity","wordCount":1814,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"bilingualism-multilingualism","title":"双语与多语社会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/bilingualism-multilingualism","wordCount":1661,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-contact","title":"语言接触","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-contact","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"language-power","title":"语言与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-power","wordCount":2307,"readingTime":10},{"seq":5,"slug":"variation-dialect","title":"语言变异与方言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/variation-dialect","wordCount":2031,"readingTime":9},{"seq":6,"slug":"language-power","title":"语言与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-power","wordCount":2063,"readingTime":9},{"seq":7,"slug":"multilingualism","title":"多语现象与语码转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/multilingualism","wordCount":1977,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语言与社会-简介\">语言与社会 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦语言的社会功能维度，从身份认同到权力关系再到多语现象，帮助读者理解语言在社会结构中的深层作用。</p>\n<p><strong>语言与身份认同</strong>分析语言如何成为个人和群体身份建构的重要工具，讲解民族认同、职业认同和性别认同在语言使用中的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>语言与权力关系</strong>探讨语言与社会权力之间的关系，分析标准语意识形态、语言歧视和语言霸权等现象的社会机制。</p>\n<p><strong>多语现象与语码转换</strong>介绍多语社会的形成背景和运作特征，讲解语码转换的语言学分析和社会动机，以及语言接触带来的语言融合现象。</p>\n<p>建议读者培养批判性的语言意识，学会从社会结构的角度审视日常语言现象。</p>\n"}